        "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall continues.\n\n* WHERE...Yentna River.\n\n* WHEN...Until noon AKDT Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.\nWater could enter several cabins along the Yentna River near Lake\nCreek.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 950 PM AKDT, river gauge reports high water levels from\nheavy rain across the advisory area. Minor flooding may be\nongoing, especially along the Yentna River near Lake Creek.\n- For Yentna River at Lake Creek:\nAt 9:",
